msgid "plugins.generic.reviewerHonor.name"
msgstr "Reviewer Recognition"

msgid "plugins.generic.reviewerHonor.description"
msgstr "An annual reviewer ranking by output, timeliness and report quality, with \"Reviewer of the Year\", \"Distinguished Reviewer\" and \"Fastest Reviewer\" awards, a public thank-you page listing only those who consent, and an official thank-you letter on the journal letterhead with the editor-in-chief signature and stamp that reviewers download themselves. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

