msgstr "Reviewer recognition"

msgid "plugins.generic.reviewerHonor.myMenu"
msgstr "Thanks & recognition"

msgid "plugins.generic.reviewerHonor.intro"
msgstr "Each reviewer's yearly indicators from OJS data. Set awards, print the thank-you letter and publish the thank-you page (names whose owners consented or you approved)."

